<h1 class="page-title">Social Media Production</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Editing and producing social media content for artists.</p>

{#- Wes Coeur, as a case study: the brief, the videos, the results (the
    headline numbers) and two of the videos. #}
<h2>Wes Coeur</h2>
<p class="standfirst">Production assistance &middot; Instagram &amp; TikTok &middot; 2026&ndash;</p>

<h3>The brief</h3>
<p>I help produce the short-form videos Melbourne artist <a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/4zjTgLNIPksuxMXCKClne9">Wes Coeur</a> posts to Instagram and TikTok, to grow an audience for his music.</p>

<h3>The videos</h3>
<p>Wes's videos are about the things he genuinely cares about, so the audience they find shares his interests, and they're the people most likely to love his music: R&amp;B, soul and electro-pop that owes as much to Prince's romance as to The Weeknd's moody glamour. I help turn his footage into tight videos that let his personality come through and keep people watching to the end. (Wes and I also frequently collaborate musically together: see <a href="/interests/music/">Music</a>.)</p>

<h3>The results</h3>
<ul class="stats">
  <li><span class="stats__n">3+ million</span> views across various platforms</li>
  <li><span class="stats__n">500 <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="visually-hidden">to</span> 5,000</span> Instagram followers</li>
  <li><span class="stats__n">0 <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span><span class="visually-hidden">to</span> 3,400</span> TikTok followers</li>
</ul>

